  "instructions": [
    "Cut the ssam wrap into a 12-inch square sheet.",
    "In a large bowl, combine the sliced cucumber, carrots, cabbage, beetroot, onion, and cilantro.",
    "Juice 1 lemon and mix the juice with some salt, black pepper, and a pinch of habanero pepper.",
    "Add this dressing to the bowl and toss to coat the vegetables.",
    "Heat the mayonnaise, Sambal Oelek, and apple cider vinegar in a small saucepan over low heat until warm and well combined.",
    "Spread the warm sauce on the center of the ssam wrap, leaving a 1-inch border around the edges.",
    "Place the vegetable mixture on top of the sauce, leaving a small border around the edges.",
    "Fold the bottom edge of the wrap over the filling, then fold in the sides and roll up the wrap to form a tight cylinder.",
    "Slice the wrap in half and serve immediately.",
    "Garnish with additional cilantro if desired."
  ],
